      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a paper for my urban sociology class about gentrification and neighborhood revitalization. Can you give me a breakdown of the common socio-economic indicators that signal a neighborhood is starting to go through a process of \"renewal\" or economic improvement?",
