    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Can you go a bit deeper into the demographic part? Like, when these shifts happen, what do the typical \"old\" residents look like compared to the new people moving in? I'm interested in the contrast in their lifestyles or how they use the neighborhood.",
